    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d415">

                <pb facs="0601" n="477" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg477"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894.48B/95: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Woods</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                        1923</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received September 20—2:32 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>58. In accordance with authorization in your 151, September 11,<anchor n="28"
                        xml:id="d415-f1"/> I presented to Count Yamamoto, Prime Minister and Acting
                    Foreign Minister, a draft for $1,000,000 in favor of Earthquake Relief Board.
                    Prime Minister showed deepest emotion and gratitude.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Woods</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
